program	errors/array_wrong_type.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot assign `String` to element of type `Int`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot assign `String` to element of type `Int`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/array_wrong_type.saw:5:8"
log	"    |"
log	" 5 |     arr[0] = \"hello\"  // Error: expected Int, got String"
log	"    |        ^"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
